                                                "sense_id": "6957ccc0-eaa4-3a7b-a981-1467a4185cb8",
                                                "text": "The city recently carried out a deer census, determining there are 313 stags (males), 798 does (females) and 214 fawns (babies) in Nara Park."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad2a3a3f-6ced-34df-9471-56e089853b6a",
                                        "entry_id": "527c8bcf-7fe1-37c5-8a15-abbf2c711cf5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pale brown colour tinted with yellow, like that of a fawn."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "13cccdb1-54b0-34eb-9870-250d38a2184a",
